    "advancement": {},
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you take the Search or Study action, you can give yourself Advantage on any ability check made as part of that action. You can use this benefit a number of times equal to your Proficiency Bonus, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest. If the check fails, the use isn’t expended.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-f0RwA5AOotW3zvOu\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Roll the check with Advantage. If it fails, give the use back on the sheet.</p></section>",
